__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
# The features MGRS browse tree (per-tile STAC items + zone/grid-zone catalogs) and its
# stac-geoparquet are generated to S3, never committed. Items live at
# features/<year>/<zone>/<gzd>/<id>.json; <zone> is two digits.
# (the items.parquet is already covered by *.parquet above)
catalog/features/*/items/
features/*/items/
catalog/features/*/[0-9][0-9]/
features/*/[0-9][0-9]/
